From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: isp: read the module's lens and colour
 data after the config select

With macos_cal_reads set on T8132, the reads after the setfile load got
as far as the lens distortion data: that request timed out, every later
one with it, and the stream did not start. macOS reads the distortion
data, the absolute colour calibration and the image rotation correction
only after it has selected a sensor config, like the sensor NVM.

Read those three together with the NVM, right after the sensor config is
selected. The default (no reads) is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 27a928c41ae18f00e6039e45bb3c4f4506637d34)
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c | 11 +++++++----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
index 9117509028..55b4a9ad34 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
@@ -1309,11 +1309,11 @@ static void isp_ch_macos_cal_reads(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch,
 		{ CISP_CMD_APPLE_CH_AWB_PRE_CCM_GAIN_GET,
 		  0x18, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_LOAD, true, "AWB pre-CCM gains" },
 		{ CISP_CMD_CH_DISTORTION_DATA_GET,
-		  0x400, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_LOAD, false, "distortion" },
+		  0x400, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_SELECT, false, "distortion" },
 		{ CISP_CMD_CH_COLOR_CAL_ABS_GET,
-		  0x18, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_LOAD, true, "colour calibration" },
+		  0x18, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_SELECT, true, "colour calibration" },
 		{ CISP_CMD_CH_IMAGE_ROTATION_CORRECTION_GET,
-		  0x24, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_LOAD, true, "rotation correction" },
+		  0x24, 0, 1, 0, ISP_CAL_AFTER_SELECT, true, "rotation correction" },
 	};
 	static bool logged;
 	size_t area = ISP_CMD_AREA_SIZE(isp_num_capmeta(isp));
@@ -1623,7 +1623,10 @@ static int isp_ch_configure_capture(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 	err = isp_cmd_ch_camera_config_select(isp, ch, isp->stream_preset.index);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
-	/* The sensor NVM can be read only once a sensor config is selected. */
+	/*
+	 * The sensor NVM, the module's lens data and its colour calibration can
+	 * be read only once a sensor config is selected.
+	 */
 	isp_ch_macos_cal_reads(isp, ch, ISP_CAL_AFTER_SELECT);
 
 	err = isp_cmd_ch_buffer_recycle_mode_set(
-- 
